#: 14520b8089ad4f3095138fc1d145eb8c
msgid ""
"竞赛数据为制表符分隔格式，每行对应一个解题步骤。以下是字段说明；该数据集使用 `SubSkills` 认知模型。详见 [DataShop "
"数据格式说明](https://pslcdatashop.web.cmu.edu/KDDCup/rules_data_format.jsp)。"
msgstr ""
"Competition data is in tab-delimited format, where each row corresponds "
"to a problem-solving step. Below are field descriptions; this dataset "
"uses the `SubSkills` cognitive model. See [DataShop Data Format "
"Specifications](https://pslcdatashop.web.cmu.edu/KDDCup/rules_data_format.jsp)"
" for details."

